    {"Peter Jackson's King Kong: The Official Game of the Movie (Ubisoft, 2005) running natively on PC: the original Xbox 360 game code statically recompiled to C++ with the ReXGlue SDK. No game code or assets are included; the game runs from your own disc image.",
